00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.720
This is a really funny voicemail.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.430
See if you can pick up on what's funny about
it.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.430
Take a listen.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:18.429
I was just wondering, are you from Father
Moton and First Amendment right?

00:00:18.429 --> 00:00:20.060
Not for office.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.060
Yeah.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.310
This is so funny.

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:27.619
So the 25th Amendment provides a mechanism
for removing Donald Trump or any president

00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:30.300
for being unfit, hilariously.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.510
The caller mentions the 21st amendment, which
ended prohibition, which was put in place

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.270
