justify removing Donald Trump?

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.640
I can't think offhand of how he would do it.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:53.780
But a funny idea, but no, it is the 25th Amendment
that could be used.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:54.940
It will not be used.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:59.010
Donald Trump's cabinet has no interest in
removing him, no matter how clearly unfit

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.880
for office he is.

